"--- ROW-LEVEL TRANSACTION AUDIT ---\n",
"Total Events in 2025:       ", total_25, "\n",
"Events Successfully Matched: ", in_both, " (These are the 'Same' items)\n",
"Events Lost (Leakage):      ", only_in_25, " (Verified 2025 rows GONE in 2026)\n",
"New Events (Growth):        ", only_in_26, " (The additional 70k+)\n",
"------------------------------------\n",
